  <ButtonText>k__BackingField: "Met au courant Jennie pour qu\u2019on puisse les
    \xE9viter\r\n"
  <NpcText>k__BackingField:
  - <Npc>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 292bca25009c3b846973697c392c826a, type: 2}
    <Expression>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 15a032d1f64921b49a6cec6c0a26887d, type: 2}
    <Text>k__BackingField:
    - "Bien re\xE7u ! Vous faites pas d\u2019soucis, Jennie et moi on a la situation
      en main."
  - <Npc>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 292bca25009c3b846973697c392c826a, type: 2}
    <Expression>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3d35d0e1530830e42b12a5e80d0329dc, type: 2}
    <Text>k__BackingField:
    - "On va leur passer sous l\u2019nez ni vus ni connus !\r\n"
